{"ID":"20240205153801-vuhqo13","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153801-vuhqo13","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153801-vuhqo13\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206113911-uzjorrv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607145557-5ortaiz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:4086,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240617110954-jj2qfpy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:10,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:10\u0026#125;","title":"106桑上寄生（桑寄生）","type":"doc","updated":"20240811092633"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206113911-uzjorrv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206113911-uzjorrv","updated":"20240206113923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产福建、两广等地。\n【性状】\t茎枝呈圆柱形，长34cm，直径0.21cm；表面红褐色或灰色，具细纵纹，并有众多细小皮孔，小枝有棕红色细毛。有时逞叶，多卷缩，完整者呈卵圆形，全缘，棕色，革质，幼叶亦被棕红色细毛。茎坚硬，断面不整齐，皮部红棕色，木榈色较浅。无臭，味涩。\n【性味】\t苦、甘，平。\n【功效】\t祛风湿，益肝肾，强筋骨，安胎。"}]},{"ID":"20240206113912-kx3jj0s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206113912-kx3jj0s","updated":"20240206113912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206113912-tapii42.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205160938-uvq4gh6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205160938-uvq4gh6","updated":"20240620164852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 237px;","style":"width: 227px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"桑寄生"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/桑寄生-20240205160938-1zi4qp8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeClosePar